# What this repository holds
#
# This repo exists to deploy the site, so it tracks the BUILT output in
# `public/` and not the sources that produced it. That is the opposite of the
# usual rule, and it is deliberate: the built site and its sources are ~736 MB
# each, and together they would put the repository past the size GitHub
# recommends. Vercel serves `public/` directly with no build step, so the
# sources are not needed to deploy.
#
# The sources stay on the machine that built them. `_quarantine/pre-rebrand/`
# holds a byte-for-byte copy of every file this project modified, which is the
# only thing that could not be reconstructed — keep that backed up locally.

# --- Capture sources (large, and not needed to deploy) ---------------------
/www.voiceflow.com/
/mintcdn.com/
/fonts.googleapis.com/
/fonts.gstatic.com/
/js.hsforms.net/
/prod-assets.sequelvideo.com/
/www.googletagmanager.com/
/d3gk2c5xim1je2.cloudfront.net/

# HTTrack launcher furniture at the project root — crawler artefacts, not site
# content. The real homepage is public/index.html.
/index.html
/backblue.gif
/fade.gif

